# Gemelo digital

version: "0.3"
name: gemelo_digital
title: Gemelo digital
description: Oficina NeoNodos con pieza emblemática.
bounds: [5.5, 3, 5.5]
spawn: [0, -1.4, -4]
ambient:
  background: [0.06, 0.04, 0.03]
  ambientColor: [0.14, 0.1, 0.07]
  tint: [1.08, 0.95, 0.78]
  fogColor: [0.06, 0.04, 0.03]
